          "text": "The relevant work order is **WO-2025-09-004 / MO-25-09-1070** (Cooler Plate Pack, Racine). Its component-issue event, source transaction **TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070**, was for **$318,250.75** (31,825,075 cents).\n\n- **Event created:** 2025-09-30T20:25:00\n- **September period entered Pending Close:** 2025-09-30T18:00:00\n- **Time late:** 145 minutes\n- **Recorded accounting status:** POSTED\n- **Status consistent with Oracle’s documented treatment?** **No.** Oracle’s Pending Close policy says newly created transactions relating to the period are not staged or processed until the period is closed or reopened. This component-issue event was created after Pending Close and is not one of the stated continued-processing exceptions.\n\nThe review was read-only. The report was submitted and verified.",
